    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. regarding the bitumen viscosity part, could you expand on how the extreme heat in the phoenix area specifically affects the binder properties during the summer months? i'm trying to figure out if the binder is just softening too much or if we're looking at something more permanent like oxidative hardening.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
